gability 증거 아님).","generation_mode":"local_rules_no_egress","limitations":["fpocket pocket candidates, ranks and scores are geometric detector output, not binding-site, affinity or druggability evidence.","Score and Druggability Score are fpocket regression scores min-max normalised across the pockets of the same execution; they are relative within one run and not comparable across runs or structures.","Volume is fpocket's Monte Carlo estimate with a clock-derived seed (seed control unsupported); fresh executions can differ, and it is not an analytical union-of-spheres volume.","Total SASA is fpocket's point-sampled surface of pocket-contacting atoms not covered by the pocket's alpha spheres; it is not whole-protein SASA or the result of the project's SASA tool.","display_center is the arithmetic mean of stored sphere centers computed by ProtView, not an fpocket value.","Coordinates refer to the projected protein-only transport input (standard-residue heavy atoms).","fpocket pocket candidates, ranks and scores are not binding-site, affinity or druggability evidence (결합 부위·친화도·druggability 증거 아님).","Druggability Score is an fpocket-specific score, not druggability evidence (fpocket 고유 점수이며 약물성 증거가 아님).","Display center: arithmetic mean of the stored alpha-sphere centers, computed by ProtView for display only; it is not an fpocket value."],"markdown_handle":"obj://run_a882dd4316184dd49c5b1aedcc5d8f2d/report_markdown/3a8ae9eeea5e3af3ff39fe9ce009a63d08b36c905e46a4a791f494feb069beca","method":{"argv":["fpocket","-f","protein.pdb","-m","3.4","-M","6.2","-D","2.4","-C","s","-e","e","-i","15","-p","0.0","--number_apol_asph_pocket","3","-v","300","-w","p"],"build":"hb88c64c_2","effective_parameters":{"argv":["<fpocket>","-f","protein.pdb","-m","3.4","-M","6.2","-D","2.4","-C","s","-e","e","-i","15","-p","0.0","--number_apol_asph_pocket","3","-v","300","-w","p"],"build":"hb88c64c_2","effective_parameters":[{"field":"pdb_path","parse_ref":"src/fparams.c:321-326","source":"argv